---
import ChapterLayout from '../../../layouts/ChapterLayout.astro';
import { getDrakeChapter } from '../../../data/story/drakeChaptersData';
import { processDrakeContentHtml } from '../../../utils/drakeContentProcessor';

const chapter = getDrakeChapter('012-treachery', 'chapter-6')!;

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith('/')
  ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL
  : `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/`;

const rawContentHtml = "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Part 6, with revelations in hand let's get the full story of the other side...\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"The_Dragoon.27s_Path\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Dragoon's_Path\">The Dragoon's Path</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Dragoon&#39;s Path\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_6?action=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: The Dragoon&#39;s Path\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Well, new chapter means new character, but not just any character!\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>PLAYABLE CHARACTER - <b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Kain_Highwind_(Dissidia_PSP)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Kain Highwind (Dissidia PSP)\">Kain</a></b>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/19/Kain_%28Dissidia_012%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20101120100910\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Kain (Dissidia 012)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/19/Kain_%28Dissidia_012%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/183?cb=20101120100910\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"183\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Kain (Dissidia 012).png\" data-image-key=\"Kain_%28Dissidia_012%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>KAIN IS HERE, KIDDIES! A strong contender for the one most popular and famous characters of the series, not to mention one of the most badass. As we now know, Kain isn't really a traitor, he's just going to extremes to ensure the survival of his comrades, but he is a good guy. Alone as he searches for more friends to get to safety, it's not an easy path with the chance of someone following him and finding out where the others are, but there's no one more qualified to walk it. Turn up the volume if you've had your PSP muted. Liam O'Brien's voice has been reported to induce orgasm in people from just a few seconds exposure, even straight males.\n</p><p>Kain has a comparatively small moveset, but it's an effective one with a cool gimmick, though very difficult to get right. Kain has, aside from his Cyclone which is just the token projectile all characters need, two ground Bravery attacks and three aerial ones. When he attacks he can press Triangle after knocking the opponent back to instantly dash after them, letting you attack again before they recover. As I said though, very hard to get right, your timing has to be precise. You can also tilt the analog stick up, down, or leave it neutral when doing the second part of his aerial combos, letting him knock the opponent in a different direction and changing if the attack does wall rush or Chase. His HP attacks consist of jumps and dives effective at many altitudes, and some mid-range spear throws.\n</p><p>Despite his limited moveset, like Yuna Kain has the moves he needs to be effective, unlike Yuna he's still fun to play as and like Lightning is rewarding when you learn his quirks. I must confess I never got the hang of any of his combos except for Lance Burst to Lance Barrage, but if you can, good for you. Jump is awesome, learn to use it effectively and you can dodge attacks and land nasty hits. Finally, Gungnir is pure win, the opponent <i>will</i> be driven across the arena by it. A fun combo, though I'm sure it can be avoided with Aerial Recovery but the AI is too dumb to do that, is to use Cyclone to blast them up into the air and towards Kain, then Jump and hit them as they're staggered. Kain is overall a blast to play as and a potent character, use him well.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Suit Kain up, the Spear we have is a bit underpowered but it'll do. Well, I had a Spear, not sure where it came from, maybe I got lucky with a random drop. If so you probably don't have one, but it's okay, there's a better weapon for Kain in this first gateway. I also bought him Iron Armor since he had no body armor, there was better stuff but I bought the Iron Armor in anticipation of later purchases of Mythril stuff, as the Iron Armor is needed for the Mythril Armor. Also, it hasn't been a big deal up until now, but I just wanna mention I reassigned Crashing Dive to forward-Circle rather than back-Circle, I'm used to my diving attacks being on the forward section and the rising ones being on the back.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Delusory Dragoon\"><img alt=\"Delusory Dragoon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Transient Gunner\"><img alt=\"Transient Gunner\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Despot\"><img alt=\"Imitation Despot\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fleeting Flash\"><img alt=\"Fleeting Flash\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Javelin\"><img alt=\"Javelin\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Pink Tail\"><img alt=\"Pink Tail\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>A Jump Chain at C3 will get all four of them, I lacked one though so I have to chain them two by two. The line-up is a Transient Gunner, an Imitation Despot, a Fleeting Flash and a Delusory Dragoon, no surprises here save for one thing. The Flash has a summon, Typhon, when called it randomly blows away a digit of your Bravery, so say, 774 Bravery will become 770, or 074 (aka 74), and so forth. I use this example because I retried three times just to check, and every time Typhon blasted the hundreds digit. The AI likes using Typhon after you Break her, keep that in mind.\n</p><p>With the opposition dead open the chests for yet another Pink Tail, and a Javelin, a new weapon for Kain. With enough gil you can trade it with your Mythril for a Mythril Spear, but don't for the reasons I've already explained.\n</p><p>As we leave, Kain has a flashback to when he met with Golbez, who told him about the cycles of war and the proof of such that lies in their memories - Kain and Golbez remember their home clearly, but Cecil, who is newly summoned, does not, because he hasn't had time to fight and remember yet. Kain doesn't remember this truth because while memories of home return and remain, when you are felled in battle and revived in the next cycle, you lose your memories of the previous cycle. This leaves a gaping question to be answered - who on Team Chaos was so badass last cycle that they beat Kain? - but we'll never find out, alas. Cecil shows up and Kain confirms he has few memories, and thus realizes Golbez told the truth.\n</p><p>On the world map, behold our map theme, Suspicion, very appropriate for the story all things considered. Immediately turn around and go back through the forest. There's an Imitation Despot here to deal with and a chest with 500 gil in the mountains beyond him. The Despot is fought in a new arena, Ultimecia's Castle, with a new Battlegen to go with it, the Time Warp, though it isn't needed for anything good. Back at the start point, the island has a Maser Eye, a new skill that saps all enemies in a chain to 50% HP. To the right is a path with an Assist Charge in a chest. Continue along and ignore the bridge and the person waiting for us, there's a path up to the Gulg volcano ring with the frozen lake, and a False Stalwart to fight. Yay, we need to fight these guys, we need their Battlegen for that coveted Hyper Ring! Remember to watch for the gold star icon when you Break him and keep Breaking him until you get it so you know you'll get the Stalwart's Hopes when you win. Hidden behind the grass near the sealed gateway up here is a Rosetta Stone, you know what to do.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"A_Naive_Ally\">A Naive Ally</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: A Naive Ally\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_6?action=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: A Naive Ally\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Back across the bridge, we meet up with Firion, who joins us as our Assist for the rest of the story. In the air he tosses our three Fire spells, weak slow-moving projectiles that are good for some other characters that could use distractions or stunning attacks, but Kain has no use for it. What he <i>does</i> have a use for is Firion's ground Assist, Rope Knife. He tosses out daggers to drag the opponent close, then slams them with a superpowered punch to knock them away. It does a lot of damage and wall rushes to set up for further blows, yeah it can be a problem if Firion knocks the opponent too far, but a charged up Jump, which you can charge as he attacks, can get you the distance you need a lot of the time. And awesomely, Crashing Dive's downward attack slams the opponent into the ground, a perfect set-up for Firion to come in. The area beyond him is small, shatter the remaining orbs to get your new chain skill and enter the blue gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"500 gil\"><img alt=\"500 gil\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/f/fc/DFF_Potion.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235732\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Potion\"><img alt=\"Potion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"21\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/f/fc/DFF_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/21?cb=20110203235732\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">2\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Despot\"><img alt=\"Imitation Despot\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/0/0d/Dissicon_ff2_Fir1.png/revision/latest?cb=20110126024837\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Assist - Firion\"><img alt=\"Assist - Firion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissicon ff2 Fir1.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissicon_ff2_Fir1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/0/0d/Dissicon_ff2_Fir1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20110126024837\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Capricious Reaper\"><img alt=\"Capricious Reaper\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">3\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">4\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fleeting Flash\"><img alt=\"Fleeting Flash\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204000919\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Phantasmal Girl\"><img alt=\"Phantasmal Girl\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Strange Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20110204000919\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Soul of Valor\"><img alt=\"Soul of Valor\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Enemy line-up is a bit more varied now, an Imitation Despot, Capricious Reaper, Fleeting Flash and Phantasmal Girl. Chain the lot of  them with a Cross Chain at B3, a Jump Chain at C3, or a Multi Chain at D2 or B3. The Despot has Thunder Crest and the tracking ground Flare, use Kain's Jump to reflect Flare. There's also some summons to look out for, the Despot has Ifrit, the Sky Pirate has Demon Wall, and the Girl has Giant of Babil. As you've noticed the game is slowly ramping up the difficulty, making opponents of higher levels more common and giving them summons and accessories. It still isn't very challenging yet but it is making a stronger effort. \n</p><p>The Strange Battle Piece is a Phantasmal Girl and she has a new, potentially deadly trick. Holy Combo is a Bravery attack that shoots five slow-moving orbs of light, but if one of them hits she can follow it up by firing four Flare fireballs at us, each fireball she turns to track us if we move. And if one of the Flares hit, she can use the HP Link Ultima, creating a sphere of magic around us to explode and damage our HP. Fortunately Holy Combo is slow and pretty easy to block. Be thankful this isn't the real Terra, her EX Mode Holy Combo is a lot harder to avoid and is one of the most powerful combos in the game.\n</p><p>During this round of fights Kain hit Level 6 and picked up Jump Boost, giving his jumps greater height. Many fights here take place in the Crystal World, another new arena. The Battlegen is the Star's Core, which unlocks three new items, two of them are the Dragonfly Orb and Bravery Orb. The latter is largely useless but the Dragonfly Orb increases EX Core absorption, giving us more EX from the cores. It's not as good as the Pearl Necklace and Attractorb in my opinion though, I'd prefer to absorb the EX Force as it appears rather than let a core absorb it all and an opponent get to it first. The third item is the Iifa Leaf, which can be traded for one each Blackcrystal Sliver, Sealed Darkness, and Star's Core. Given how much we've fought in the Chaos Shrine and World of Darkness, the first two should be in abundance. The chests have 500 gil and a Soul of Valor.\n</p><p>Not much left to do on the world map except go to the next gateway.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/0/0d/Dissicon_ff2_Fir1.png/revision/latest?cb=20110126024837\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Assist - Firion\"><img alt=\"Assist - Firion\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissicon ff2 Fir1.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissicon_ff2_Fir1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/0/0d/Dissicon_ff2_Fir1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20110126024837\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fallacious Tree\"><img alt=\"Fallacious Tree\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/1/1e/DFF_Expert_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204003912\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Despot\"><img alt=\